article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="terrifying-zeal" data-stratagem-type="source-untyped" data-source-label="Interrogation Conclave Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;CHAPLAIN&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;ended-charge-move&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-terrifying-zeal">Terrifying Zeal</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Interrogation Conclave Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Charge phase, when a friendly CHAPLAIN unit ends a charge move.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That CHAPLAIN unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one enemy unit (excluding MONSTER/VEHICLE units) engaged with your unit. That enemy unit makes a leadership roll: ▪ If that leadership roll fails, that enemy unit’s attacks have ‑1 to hit rolls until the end of the turn.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="wages-of-cowardice" data-stratagem-type="source-untyped" data-source-label="Interrogation Conclave Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;CHAPLAIN&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;enemy-ended-fall-back-after-engagement&quot;,&quot;not-within-engagement-range&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-wages-of-cowardice">Wages of Cowardice</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Interrogation Conclave Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit that was engaged with a friendly CHAPLAIN unit ends a fall-back move, if that CHAPLAIN unit is unengaged.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That CHAPLAIN unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3&quot;. MASTERS OF PRECISION EXCRUCIATION LEAD THE DARK ANGELS IN CONDEMNATORY STRIKES</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="limitless-zeal" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;CHAPLAIN&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-limitless-zeal">Limitless Zeal</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">This Interrogator‑Chaplain is restless and dynamic, not only in his pursuit of enemies but also when eliciting their screamed confessions. CHAPLAIN model only. This unit has +1 to charge rolls.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="inescapable-interrogation" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;CHAPLAIN&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-inescapable-interrogation">Inescapable Interrogation</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Whatever physical obfuscation the enemy hides behind mirrors only the lies shrouding their souls. This experienced Chaplain is deceived by neither. CHAPLAIN model only. This unit’s ranged attacks have [IGNORES COVER].</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="lion-s-blade-task-force" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Lion's Blade Task Force <span class="detachment-dp">2DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="overpowering-exaction" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="Lion’s Blade Task Force · Strategic Ploy Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-overpowering-exaction">Overpowering Exaction</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Lion’s Blade Task Force · Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Command phase or the start of the Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit. That enemy unit must take a Battle‑shock test. When doing so, if your unit has the Deathwing or Ravenwing keyword, subtract 1 from the result.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You can only use this Stratagem once per battle round.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="knights-of-iron" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="Lion’s Blade Task Force · Strategic Ploy Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;RAVENWING&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-knights-of-iron">Knights of Iron</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Lion’s Blade Task Force · Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Ravenwing unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Normal, Advance or Charge move, it can move horizontally through terrain features.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="lion-s-blade-task-force-armour-of-contempt" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="Lion’s Blade Task Force · Battle Tactic Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-armour-of-contempt">Armour of Contempt</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Lion’s Blade Task Force · Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="illuminating-fire" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="Lion’s Blade Task Force · Battle Tactic Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;RAVENWING&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;selected-to-shoot&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-illuminating-fire">Illuminating Fire</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Lion’s Blade Task Force · Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase, just after a Ravenwing unit from your army has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That Ravenwing unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of your unit that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly Deathwing unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="strength-in-unity" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="Lion’s Blade Task Force · Battle Tactic Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-strength-in-unity">Strength in Unity</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Lion’s Blade Task Force · Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>If that enemy unit is within Engagement Range of one or more Ravenwing units from your army, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that enemy unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll. If that enemy unit is within Engagement Range of one or more Deathwing units from your army, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that enemy unit makes an attack, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of the target, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>A unit cannot be targeted by this and the Armour of Contempt Stratagem in the same phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="inescapable-wrath" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="Lion’s Blade Task Force · Strategic Ploy Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;DEATHWING&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;DEATHWING&quot;,&quot;WALKER&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;within-6-of-enemy-unit&quot;,&quot;eligible-to-declare-charge&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-inescapable-wrath">Inescapable Wrath</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Lion’s Blade Task Force · Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of your opponent’s Charge phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Deathwing Infantry or Deathwing Walker unit from your army that is within 6&quot; of one or more enemy units and would be eligible to declare a charge against one or more of those enemy units if it were your Charge phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit now declares a charge that only targets one or more of those enemy units, and you resolve that charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>Note that even if this charge is successful, your unit does not receive any Charge bonus this turn. 1CP 1CP 1CP 1CP 1CP 2CP</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="calibanite-armaments" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-calibanite-armaments">Calibanite Armaments</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">The eldest relic weapons of the Dark Angels trace their lineage to ancient Caliban and are wielded only by the greatest champions of the Unforgiven. Adeptus Astartes model only. Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of the bearer’s melee weapons.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="lord-of-the-hunt" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;RAVENWING&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-lord-of-the-hunt">Lord of the Hunt</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">This veteran of the Ravenwing has spent mortal lifetimes in the saddle, leading mechanised cavalry to battle on countless worlds. Ravenwing model only. The bearer’s unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back and you can re‑roll Desperate Escape tests taken for models in the bearer’s unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="stalwart-champion" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;anyKeywords&quot;:[&quot;CAPTAIN&quot;,&quot;CHAPLAIN&quot;,&quot;LIEUTENANT&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-stalwart-champion">Stalwart Champion</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Possessed of obdurate will, this warrior champion instils an indomitable resolve and absolute refusal to cede ground within his brothers. Captain, Chaplain or Lieutenant model only. While the bearer’s unit is not Battle‑shocked, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in the bearer’s unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="fulgus-magna" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;DEATHWING&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-fulgus-magna">Fulgus Magna</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">This ancient teleport homer projects a powerful narrow‑band signal, enabling the teleportarium chambers of orbiting vessels to lock on to the bearer even amid severe atmospheric or empyric disturbances. Deathwing model only. Once per battle, at the end of your opponent’s turn, if the bearer’s unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, remove the bearer’s unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="unforgiven-task-force" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Unforgiven Task Force <span class="detachment-dp">2DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-pennant-of-remembrance" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ANCIENT&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-pennant-of-remembrance">Pennant of Remembrance</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Ancient model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability. While that unit is Battle-shocked, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability instead.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-shroud-of-heroes" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-shroud-of-heroes">Shroud of Heroes</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">ADEPTUS ASTARTES model only. (Once per battle, per army) When this model is destroyed, at the end of the phase, roll one D6: ▪ On a 2+, set up this model on the battlefield, unengaged and as close as possible to where it was destroyed. This model is not part of an attached unit and its unit has a starting strength of 1. This model has 3 wounds remaining, or its full wounds remaining if this model was battle-shocked when it was destroyed</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-stubborn-tenacity" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-stubborn-tenacity">Stubborn Tenacity</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Adeptus Astartes model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll if that unit is below its Starting Strength, and add 1 to the Wound roll as well if that unit is Battle-shocked and below its Starting Strength.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-weapons-of-the-first-legion" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-weapons-of-the-first-legion">Weapons of the First Legion</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Adeptus Astartes model only. Add 1 to the Attacks, Strength and Damage characteristics of the bearer’s melee weapons. While the bearer is Battle-shocked, add 2 to the Attacks, Strength and Damage characteristics of the bearer’s melee weapons instead.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="wrath-of-the-rock" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Wrath of the Rock <span class="detachment-dp">3DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="inescapable-justice" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="Wrath of the Rock · Battle Tactic Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;CHARACTER&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;on-battlefield&quot;,&quot;oath-of-moment-target-destroyed&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-inescapable-justice">Inescapable Justice</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Wrath of the Rock · Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Any phase, just after your Oath of Moment target is destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes Character unit that is on the battlefield.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one enemy unit within 12&quot; and visible to your unit. That enemy unit becomes your Oath of Moment target until the start of your next Command phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="tactical-mastery" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="Wrath of the Rock · Battle Tactic Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-tactical-mastery">Tactical Mastery</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Wrath of the Rock · Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced. If your unit has the Ravenwing keyword, it is also eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="lion-s-will" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="Wrath of the Rock · Strategic Ploy Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;within-engagement-range&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-lions-will">Lion’s Will</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Wrath of the Rock · Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Command phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the start of your next Command phase, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in your unit. In addition, until the end of the turn, if your unit does not have the Deathwing, Ravenwing or Vehicle keyword, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="relics-of-the-dark-age" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="Wrath of the Rock · Strategic Ploy Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;MOUNTED&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-selected-to-shoot&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-relics-of-the-dark-age">Relics of the Dark Age</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Wrath of the Rock · Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes Infantry or Adeptus Astartes Mounted unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, add 2 to the Strength characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="wrath-of-the-rock-armour-of-contempt" data-stratagem-type="battle-tactic" data-source-label="Wrath of the Rock · Battle Tactic Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-armour-of-contempt">Armour of Contempt</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Wrath of the Rock · Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="leonine-aggression" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="Wrath of the Rock · Strategic Ploy Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;within-3-of-enemy-or-deathwing-within-6&quot;,&quot;eligible-to-declare-charge&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-stratagem-leonine-aggression">Leonine Aggression</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Wrath of the Rock · Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of your opponent’s Charge phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army within 3&quot; of one or more enemy units, or one Deathwing unit from your army within 6&quot; of one or more enemy units.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit now declares a charge that only targets one or more of those enemy units, and you resolve that charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>Note that even if this charge is successful, your unit does not receive any Charge bonus this turn. 2CP 1CP 1CP 1CP 1CP 1CP</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="tempered-in-battle-aura" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-tempered-in-battle-aura">Tempered in Battle (Aura)</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">A veteran of the Inner Circle, this warrior inspires those around them to hold the line amidst the heat and chaos of battle. Adeptus Astartes model only. While a friendly Adeptus Astartes unit is within 6&quot; of this model, you can re‑roll Battle‑shock and Leadership tests taken for that unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="ancient-weapons" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-ancient-weapons">Ancient Weapons</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">The vaults of the Dark Angels contain many relics from Humanity’s distant past. This soldier has been granted the honour of bearing such a weapon to battle. Adeptus Astartes model only. Improve the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the bearer by 2, and improve the Armour Penetration and Damage characteristics of those weapons by 1.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="deathwing-assault" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;DEATHWING&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;],&quot;allAbilities&quot;:[&quot;core-deep-strike&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-deathwing-assault-2">Deathwing Assault</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">A veteran inductee of the Inner Circle, this champion has served amongst the Deathwing for centuries and become an unmatched master of teleportarium insertions. Deathwing model with the Deep Strike ability only. The bearer’s unit can be set up using the Deep Strike ability in the Reinforcements step of your first, second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="lord-of-the-ravenwing" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-eligibility="{&quot;tags&quot;:[],&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;model&quot;,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;RAVENWING&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}},&quot;assignment&quot;:{&quot;maxOwners&quot;:1,&quot;enhancementChoices&quot;:1,&quot;payPointsPerOwner&quot;:true}}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="dark-angels-enhancement-lord-of-the-ravenwing">Lord of the Ravenwing</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">This commander has mastered the art of cavalry combat, instinctively noticing the opportune position to strike and navigating the chaos of battle with preternatural precision. Ravenwing model only. Y ou can re‑roll Advance and Charge rolls made for the bearer’s unit.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="vengeful-hosts" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Vengeful Hosts <span class="detachment-dp">1DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="vengeful-hosts-meteoric-onslaught" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;FLY&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-meteoric-onslaught">METEORIC ONSLAUGHT</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES FLY INFANTRY unit that made a charge move this turn is selected to attack.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES FLY INFANTRY unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit’s melee attacks have +1 S.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="vengeful-hosts-purge-by-sectors" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;FLY&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-purge-by-sectors">PURGE BY SECTORS</button></h3></d