inator-armor&quot;,&quot;unit-bladeguard-veteran-squad&quot;,&quot;unit-caanok-var&quot;,&quot;unit-captain-in-terminator-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-chaplain-in-terminator-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-darnath-lysander&quot;,&quot;unit-librarian-in-terminator-armour&quot;,&quot;unit-marneus-calgar-in-armour-of-antilochus&quot;,&quot;unit-sternguard-veteran-squad&quot;,&quot;unit-terminator-assault-squad&quot;,&quot;unit-terminator-squad&quot;,&quot;unit-vanguard-veteran-squad-with-jump-packs&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-terrifying-proficiency">TERRIFYING PROFICIENCY</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS ASTARTES TERMINATOR, BLADEGUARD VETERAN SQUAD, STERNGUARD VETERAN SQUAD or VANGUARD VETERAN SQUAD unit from your army that made a Charge move this turn and destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="1st-company-task-force-duty-and-honour" data-stratagem-type="strategic-ploy" data-source-label="STRATEGIC PLOY Stratagem" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-ancient-in-terminator-armor&quot;,&quot;unit-bladeguard-veteran-squa